# Personal Notes For This Project

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md`. It is gitignored, loads alongside
CLAUDE.md, and is never shared with the team.

Use it for preferences that are yours alone:

- The local port you run the dev server on
- Paths to tools that live somewhere unusual on your machine
- Reminders about a part of the codebase you keep forgetting

Never put credentials here. It is gitignored, not encrypted.
